BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 679.0 Tm (Classic UFS1 did not start with a modern metadata journal. Its reliability depended on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 662.0 Tm (write ordering, synchronous updates and offline fsck. Soft updates introduced dependency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm (tracking to order metadata writes safely with fewer synchronous operations; it was an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628.0 Tm (implementation improvement and not a universal property of every UFS1 image.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 599.0 Tm (Recovery checks cylinder group counts, allocated blocks, inode references, directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (connectivity and link counts. Soft-updates state and other platform-specific recovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (extensions require separate interpretation. A filesystem checker cannot regard replicated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548.0 Tm (superblocks as proof that the last directory update completed.) Tj ET
